<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Textron raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Textron raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said Friday it had raised its rating on Textron Inc to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- The company's shares were off one to 97-1/2 in early trade.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street Desk, (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
